@startuml
title Relational Access V1 - L2 ShardingSphere-JDBC
autonumber

participant "Component Repository" as Repo
participant "MyBatisAccessResolver" as Resolver
participant "SpringMyBatisAccess" as Access
participant "SqlSessionTemplate" as Session
participant "ShardingSphere logical DataSource" as SS
database "Physical shards" as DB

Repo -> Resolver : resolve("orders-sharding")
Resolver --> Repo : logical Access
Repo -> Access : execute*(Mapper, logical_table)
Access -> Session : getMapper(ComponentMapper)
Session -> SS : logical SQL + sharding column
SS -> SS : parse / route / rewrite
SS -> DB : physical SQL
DB --> Repo : result

note over Resolver,Access
orders-sharding selects the application Access.
It is not ShardingSphere's ds_0 or ds_1.
end note

note right of SS
Created and configured by the application / ShardingSphere integration,
not by Relational Access.
end note
@enduml
